# Code Review Dashboard sync jobs (phase 3: SSE live refresh).
# The 15-minute incremental cron and the SyncTrigger stale-while-revalidate
# spawn are gone: app:refresh-worker (a supervisord program, see
# docker/supervisord.conf) now owns on-demand incremental refreshes, driven
# by POST /api/refresh. Nightly at 03:00: open-MR refresh + retention +
# Slack new/stale-MR notifications. User ranking (all-time MR counts for
# list ordering) recomputed daily at 04:33.
0 3 * * * root php /app/bin/console app:sync --refresh-open --notify-slack >> /var/log/cr-dashboard/sync.log 2>&1
33 4 * * * root php /app/bin/console app:rank-users >> /var/log/cr-dashboard/sync.log 2>&1
